Subject: [PATCH] feat(landing-cms): editable landing page CMS for admin
 settings

- backend module landing-cms with public + admin controllers
- landing_cms_config table (JSON content, draft/published, locale)
- asset upload via existing storage module (public bucket, XENNIC workspace)
- landing page renders from CMS with default fallbacks; SEO/favicon from content
- admin landing editor with tabbed UI (branding, SEO, header, hero,
  calculations, features, articles, pricing, CTA, footer) and image upload
- DB migration and docs
